## Third-party content redistributed here

This project is an independent companion to the official Microsoft sample
"AI Foundry Hosted Agents with Custom Frameworks", published by Microsoft
Corporation under the MIT License as part of the Azure-Samples/AI-Gateway
repository (https://github.com/Azure-Samples/AI-Gateway).

`vendor/ai-gateway/` **does redistribute** part of that repository: the lab
folder in full — its Bicep template, APIM policies, notebooks and agent
sources — together with the shared Bicep modules the template depends on, and
`shared/utils.py`. Those files are byte-identical to upstream and remain the
work and the property of Microsoft Corporation and the lab's contributors. They
are redistributed under their own MIT License, which permits it provided the
copyright and permission notices are preserved; that license is included
unmodified at `vendor/ai-gateway/LICENSE.md`, and `vendor/ai-gateway/NOTICE.md`
records the exact upstream commit each file came from.

They are vendored so this repository's deployment automation runs from a fresh
clone, with no second checkout required. Nothing in `vendor/` is covered by the
copyright notice at the top of this file.

Also reused under that same MIT License, outside `vendor/`:
`assets/ai-foundry-hosted-agents.gif`, the lab's own architecture diagram — see
ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md for the full attribution.
